graph TD
    A[Raw CSV/Excel Data] --> B[Data Ingestion: analyzer.py]
    B -->|Pandas Aggregation| C(Deterministic Evidence Facts)
    
    C -->|Total Cases, Ages, etc.| D[Context Assembly: prompts.py]
    
    D -->|Scoped Prompts| E[AI Generation: generator.py]
    E -->|Gemini API Request| F((Gemini 2.5 LLM))
    F -->|Generated Narrative Text| E
    
    E --> G[Report Compiler: main.py]
    C -->|Deterministic Headers| G
    
    G --> H[Final PADER_Report.md]
